    <PhotoMode.PatchLifetime>Harmony patch lifetime</PhotoMode.PatchLifetime>
    <PhotoMode.PatchLifetime.Dynamic>Patch only while Photo Mode is active</PhotoMode.PatchLifetime.Dynamic>
    <PhotoMode.PatchLifetime.Dynamic.Tooltip>Default. Applies Photo Mode's Harmony patches while entering Photo Mode and removes them when it closes. This avoids Photo Mode patch callbacks during normal gameplay, but entering or leaving Photo Mode may briefly pause while Harmony rebuilds affected methods.</PhotoMode.PatchLifetime.Dynamic.Tooltip>
    <PhotoMode.PatchLifetime.AlwaysLoaded>Keep Harmony patches loaded</PhotoMode.PatchLifetime.AlwaysLoaded>
    <PhotoMode.PatchLifetime.AlwaysLoaded.Tooltip>Compatibility mode. Registers Photo Mode's Harmony patches when the game loads and keeps them registered. Opening and closing Photo Mode is faster, but patched game methods run a small inactive Photo Mode check during normal gameplay. Choose this if changing patches while playing conflicts with another mod.</PhotoMode.PatchLifetime.AlwaysLoaded.Tooltip>
    <PhotoMode.PatchLifetime.Locked>Cannot be changed while Photo Mode is active or transitioning.</PhotoMode.PatchLifetime.Locked>

